dsh-skill-mini-manager README · 方式 B：不用 git（Download ZIP）：1. 打开 https://github.com/runcat-tommy/dsh-skill-mini-manager
2. Code → Download ZIP
3. 解压，然后：
   dsh plugin --profile web add D:\path\to\dsh-skill-mini-manager-main
```

⚠️ Download ZIP 解压出来的目录带 `-main` 后缀，`add` 要指向**解压后的那个目录**，
不要指向 `.zip` 文件本身。
json
{
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": ["@deepseek-ai/dsh-base", "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app", "dsh-skill-mini-manager"]
    }
  }
}
```

dsh-skill-mini-manager README · Option B: no git required (Download ZIP)：1. Open https://github.com/runcat-tommy/dsh-skill-mini-manager
2. Code -> Download ZIP
3. Unzip, then:
   dsh plugin --profile web add D:\path\to\dsh-skill-mini-manager-main
```

⚠️ The Download ZIP folder keeps a `-main` suffix, so point `add` at the **unzipped
directory** — not at the `.zip` file itself.
json
{
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": ["@deepseek-ai/dsh-base", "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app", "dsh-skill-mini-manager"]
    }
  }
}
```
